graph TD
    A[G Protein Activation] --> B[Adenylyl Cyclase]
    B --> C[ATP Conversion]
    C --> D[cAMP Production]
    D --> E[cAMP Diffusion]
    E --> F[PKA Activation]
    F --> G[Target Protein Phosphorylation]
    G --> H[Cellular Response]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    D --> I[EPAC Activation]
    I --> J[Rap1 Activation]
    J --> K[Cell Adhesion Response]
    
    %% Termination
    H --> L[PDE Activation]
    L --> M[cAMP Hydrolysis]
    M --> N[Signal Termination]
    
    %% Feedback regulation
    H --> O[Phosphatase Activation]
    O --> P[Protein Dephosphorylation]
    P --> Q[Response Termination]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[Adenylyl Cyclase] --> B
    S[PKA] --> F
    T[EPAC] --> I
    U[PDE] --> L
    V[Phosphatases] --> O
    W[ATP] --> C
    X[cAMP] --> D
    
